,"page":"stories/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","order":485,"story_date":"2015-02-11","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":46,"quote":"That will not be possible. Your tribe of necromancers is a stain on her land that she cannot tolerate.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=That%20will%20not%20be,that%20she%20cannot%20tolerate.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"No End and No Beginning","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2015-02-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=That%20will%20not%20be,that%20she%20cannot%20tolerate.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"No End and No Beginning\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11-e5","era":null,"summary":"Dromoka explains that binding the dead to serve the living is necromancy, which she cannot tolerate, though she respects the Abzan.","participants":["dromoka","daghatar","sohemus","the-remembrance"],"location":"the-meeting-rocks","importance":"major","page":"stories/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","order":485,"story_date":"2015-02-11","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":52,"quote":"as long as your people are tainted by necromancy, our brood will continue to wipe yours clean from the desert.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=as%20long%20as%20your,clean%20from%20the%20desert.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"No End and No Beginning","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2015-02-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=as%20long%20as%20your,clean%20from%20the%20desert.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"No End and No Beginning\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11-e6","era":null,"summary":"The Remembrance urges Daghatar to strike Dromoka, but he chooses instead to sacrifice it.","participants":["the-remembrance","daghatar","dromoka"],"location":"the-meeting-rocks","importance":"major","page":"stories/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","order":485,"story_date":"2015-02-11","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"Raise me up. Strike your enemy down, now.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=Raise%20me%20up.%20Strike%20your%20enemy%20down%2C%20now.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"No End and No Beginning","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2015-02-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=Raise%20me%20up.%20Strike%20your%20enemy%20down%2C%20now.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"No End and No Beginning\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11-e7","era":null,"summary":"Daghatar shatters the Remembrance with the mace, destroying the ancestors it held.","participants":["daghatar","the-remembrance"],"location":"the-meeting-rocks","importance":"major","page":"stories/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","order":485,"story_date":"2015-02-11","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":59,"quote":"He slammed it down again, and again, until it shattered into a thousand shimmering shards.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=He%20slammed%20it%20down,a%20thousand%20shimmering%20shards.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"No End and No Beginning","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2015-02-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=He%20slammed%20it%20down,a%20thousand%20shimmering%20shards.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"No End and No Beginning\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11-e8","era":null,"summary":"Daghatar orders every kin-tree uprooted and necromancy forbidden, and Dromoka nods; Merel warns of civil war.","participants":["daghatar","merel","dromoka","kin-trees"],"location":"the-meeting-rocks","importance":"major","page":"stories/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","order":485,"story_date":"2015-02-11","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"Uproot every kin-tree. The practice of necromancy is hereby forbidden.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=Uproot%20every%20kin%2Dtree.%20The,necromancy%20is%20hereby%20forbidden.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"No End and No Beginning","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nik Davidson"],"date":"2015-02-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/no-end-and-no-beginning-2015-02-11#:~:text=Uproot%20every%20kin%2Dtree.%20The,necromancy%20is%20hereby%20forbidden.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"No End and No Beginning\" by Nik Davidson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e16","era":null,"summary":"Daghatar receives Yasova's letter ab